        "message": "Walking skeleton: CI Signal Trust flaky-test detection slice\n\nThin end-to-end vertical slice exercising the founding ADR architecture:\nwebhook (HMAC) -> ingest -> Postgres (Drizzle) -> pure classifier -> FFR +\nquarantine report (read API + CLI). Includes healthz/readyz, structured pino\nlogs, strict TypeBox validation, idempotent ingestion, Vitest unit + real-\nPostgres E2E tests, Biome lint, Docker packaging, and a GitHub Actions CI\npipeline (build + lint + test + coverage gate + dependency audit + secret scan).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Paperclip <noreply@paperclip.ing>",
